      "text": [
        "4522 - وَ قَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : \"لاَ يَنْبَغِي لِلْمَرْأَةِ أَنْ تُجَمِّرَ ثَوْبَهَا إِذَا خَرَجَتْ مِنْ بَيْتِهَا\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4522 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"It is not appropriate for a woman to perfume her clothes with incense when she leaves her house.\""
        ]
      }
